WEBVTT

00:02.800 --> 00:04.860
Clean up phase, complete.

00:04.860 --> 00:06.870
Condition, all green.

00:06.870 --> 00:10.020
Increase the tune rate with the Broom to 0.02.

00:10.020 --> 00:11.030
Maryoku Level...

00:11.030 --> 00:14.610
No problem with the body and its sensory organ.

00:14.610 --> 00:17.000
Awakening the subject.

00:17.000 --> 00:18.020
5.

00:18.020 --> 00:19.040
4.

00:19.040 --> 00:20.160
3.

00:20.160 --> 00:21.220
2.

00:22.170 --> 00:23.040
Contact.

00:41.530 --> 00:43.820
We're done, Akari-san.

00:43.820 --> 00:46.520
Your next periodical check up will be in seven days time.

01:20.330 --> 01:24.250
Forgive me Mikoto, for not being able to come and see you.

01:25.420 --> 01:28.280
Only two more jewels left to collect before we obtain all seven of them.

01:28.280 --> 01:31.570
Once we obtain them, we can then protect...

01:32.400 --> 01:35.990
This world that you once saved.

03:21.990 --> 03:24.220
Ah! My assignmen-!!

03:27.530 --> 03:30.350
Hiiragi-senpai, are you okay?

03:30.350 --> 03:34.600
The 'fallen man' fell. It must mean that you're going to repeat another year.

03:34.600 --> 03:36.480
Don't make it sound like it's an omen!

03:36.480 --> 03:38.030
How was your exam?

03:40.630 --> 03:42.250
Not well, I take it.

03:48.110 --> 03:49.260
Yes?

03:49.260 --> 03:53.220
Akari-chan, welco- Ah! So cute!

03:53.760 --> 03:55.630
This is a ferret.

03:56.140 --> 03:57.690
Its name is Don Peri.

03:58.840 --> 04:01.550
Ah, sorry. Let me open the door for you.

04:14.650 --> 04:19.630
Now then, a toast to Akarin who will be staying with us. Cheers!

04:23.040 --> 04:24.960
Welcome, Akari-chan.

04:24.960 --> 04:26.510
Let's get along together from now on.

04:26.990 --> 04:28.620
It is my mission.

04:33.330 --> 04:36.950
Hey, Don Peri, let's get along while we're here, okay?

04:38.470 --> 04:39.920
It completely ignored me.

04:39.920 --> 04:42.390
This guy isn't cute at all.

04:48.450 --> 04:50.190
He's really taken a liking to you, hasn't he?

04:50.190 --> 04:51.240
Where do you see that?!

04:51.240 --> 04:53.870
That light bite there, it's a sign of friendship.

04:53.870 --> 04:56.830
A light bite you say? It left its tooth marks on my finger!

04:56.830 --> 04:58.740
Here, look at this! See?

04:58.740 --> 05:00.770
Ah, looks like it's ready.

05:01.440 --> 05:04.020
I wonder if it turned out okay.

05:05.610 --> 05:06.730
So...

05:07.540 --> 05:09.740
Are you okay?

05:09.740 --> 05:12.770
Yes, the adjustments went fine.

05:14.680 --> 05:15.580
I see.

05:18.360 --> 05:19.990
Sorry for making you wait.

05:21.490 --> 05:23.920
It's a tomato and onion tart.

05:23.920 --> 05:27.530
Ah, it's your special dish.

05:27.530 --> 05:31.260
Yes, I used to make a lot of it when I was living alone.

05:31.260 --> 05:34.510
I think you're really going to like it too, Akarin.

05:34.510 --> 05:36.020
Please have some.

05:47.300 --> 05:48.030
It's delicious.

05:48.030 --> 05:49.230
Really?

05:50.010 --> 05:50.820
I'm glad.

05:52.210 --> 05:53.950
This is the taste.

05:53.950 --> 05:55.290
Ah, that's right!

05:55.830 --> 05:58.450
I have some pacific cod salad.

05:58.450 --> 06:00.210
Let me get it.

06:07.650 --> 06:08.760
Hey...

07:01.520 --> 07:06.000
If I can get to school every day starting tomorrow, my attendance should be enough.

07:06.530 --> 07:08.750
All that's left is my exam's results.

07:09.860 --> 07:13.990
Wait a second, that exam was for my second year, wasn't it?

07:14.990 --> 07:18.250
Can I really graduate?

07:18.840 --> 07:25.280
No, no, if I can gather all the jewels before Elis' birthday, the mission will be over and I can get to third year!

07:25.790 --> 07:31.350
No, no, if I fail my exam... will I be staying in second year next year?!

07:32.760 --> 07:34.930
This must be another one of Anzelotte's conspiracies!

07:36.800 --> 07:43.590
Oji-sama, my classmate Akari-chan will be staying with us starting today.

07:44.160 --> 07:47.440
She'll be staying here with her pet, Don Peri.

07:47.840 --> 07:52.700
Even my room where I have stayed alone all this time has become lively.

07:53.860 --> 08:00.460
Everyone said my cooking for today's welcoming party was delicious.

08:02.050 --> 08:11.010
But the truth is, I'd be happier if I could protect myself rather than making others happy with my cooking.

08:14.150 --> 08:17.720
Tomorrow, the second years will be having a skating class.

08:17.720 --> 08:21.570
Of course, Akari-chan and Hiiragi-senpai will be coming with me.

08:22.640 --> 08:26.780
I hope this finds you in good health.

08:27.360 --> 08:33.010
I am looking forward to meeting you on my birthday on the 14th of March.

08:34.260 --> 08:37.580
From your beloved Elis.

08:44.420 --> 08:45.120
Yes?

08:46.510 --> 08:48.170
I'm done bathing...

08:49.650 --> 08:51.170
What is it? A love letter?

08:51.170 --> 08:54.180
No it isn't! This is for my Oji-sama.

08:54.180 --> 08:55.870
A letter for your Oji-sama?

08:55.870 --> 08:56.700
Yes.

08:56.700 --> 09:00.960
He's looking more and more like Daddy Long Legs.

09:00.960 --> 09:05.690
Elis-chan, just like in the end of the book, you should marry your Oji-sama!

09:05.690 --> 09:09.440
N-No way, he is my Oji-sama after all.

09:09.440 --> 09:10.850
It's impossible.

09:10.850 --> 09:14.220
Still, you've never met him before, right?

09:14.220 --> 09:16.890
He might just turn out to be a young man.

09:16.890 --> 09:20.330
But a story is different from reality.

09:23.390 --> 09:25.320
This is all Anzelotte's fault!!

09:25.320 --> 09:26.540
Damn her!!!

09:25.770 --> 09:27.010
Hiiragi...

09:27.010 --> 09:29.720
I'm not going to drop anymore!

09:28.760 --> 09:29.720
Shut up!

09:29.720 --> 09:31.300
You're disturbing the neighborhood.

09:32.590 --> 09:34.000
You smell!

09:34.560 --> 09:37.000
D-Did you change your clothes?!

09:36.010 --> 09:37.000
What the hell are you doing?!

09:37.000 --> 09:38.830
I'll wash it for you so take it off!

09:38.830 --> 09:40.970
And go take a bath!

09:40.970 --> 09:45.000
I'm not going to die if I don't bathe for two or three days.

09:45.000 --> 09:47.260
I'll tell everyone your secret...

09:47.260 --> 09:49.390
Please, anything but that...

09:49.390 --> 09:52.190
Okay, sure, if you get it then get moving!

09:53.950 --> 09:58.810
Geez, at least make yourself suitable as someone who protects Elis-chan!

09:58.810 --> 10:02.000
I can stand you being the 'fallen man', but not a 'smelly man'!

10:08.470 --> 10:09.500
You are...

10:12.270 --> 10:16.580
I was worried about you so I came to see how you were doing.

10:19.520 --> 10:22.490
It seems like your mission is going well.

10:23.980 --> 10:28.570
I pray that you'll be able to gather all of the jewels before your next birthday.

10:29.890 --> 10:31.060
How did you know...?

10:32.020 --> 10:35.490
I know everything about you, Elis.

10:35.490 --> 10:38.490
Because I too, am one of those who protect you.

10:47.490 --> 10:50.870
Geez that guy is really troublesome...

10:58.020 --> 11:00.130
What are you doing, Elis-chan?

11:00.130 --> 11:01.890
No, nothing at all.

11:01.890 --> 11:03.670
But you're blushing.

11:04.550 --> 11:06.840
It's nothing, really!

11:14.010 --> 11:17.690
But somehow, I felt like there was a human presence.

11:17.690 --> 11:19.320
Maybe it's my imagination.

11:19.320 --> 11:23.480
Though, I don't mind as long as Elis isn't in danger.

11:23.480 --> 11:25.600
Elis-chan was...

11:26.160 --> 11:29.160
Elis-chan! Don't go into the bathroom!

12:06.760 --> 12:08.990
Good. Now, is everyone here?

12:08.990 --> 12:11.200
Hiiragi-kun still hasn't arrived yet!

12:11.200 --> 12:12.810
Him again?

12:12.810 --> 12:14.470
It's always him.

12:14.470 --> 12:17.550
I even went to wake him up today.

12:17.550 --> 12:20.340
Maybe he went back to sleep. He only has himself to blame.

12:20.340 --> 12:23.970
Hiiragi Renji, abse-

12:23.180 --> 12:24.880
Stop right there!

12:24.880 --> 12:28.140
Just in time!!

12:29.000 --> 12:30.620
Hiiragi-senpai!

12:40.190 --> 12:42.820
Hiiragi Renji, late.

12:50.450 --> 12:56.000
Sensei, I barely made it on time, right? Please don't mark me as late.

12:56.000 --> 12:57.010
No.

12:57.010 --> 12:57.920
Come on!

12:58.330 --> 13:03.360
I'm already in danger. Being late three times makes one absence, right?

13:03.360 --> 13:07.530
I'll be repeating my year even if I pass my exam like this!

13:07.530 --> 13:09.390
A late is a late.

13:09.390 --> 13:10.410
Sensei!

13:36.410 --> 13:39.010
Akari-chan is so cool...

13:39.010 --> 13:40.630
Then I too...!

13:45.100 --> 13:46.720
Ouch...

13:51.000 --> 13:51.870
Here.

13:51.870 --> 13:53.360
Hiiragi-senpai...

13:53.360 --> 13:55.430
Is this your first time skating?

13:55.430 --> 13:56.310
Yes.

14:01.020 --> 14:04.960
You're the type that stumbles everywhere, aren't you?

14:05.620 --> 14:06.860
I'm sorry.

14:06.860 --> 14:07.610
For always...

14:10.200 --> 14:11.840
Come on, let's practice.

14:11.840 --> 14:13.200
Hold on to me.

14:15.080 --> 14:17.060
Okay, please.

14:20.260 --> 14:22.510
Good, that's the way.

14:25.550 --> 14:27.560
Looking good, looking good!

14:27.560 --> 14:29.720
Don't forget to look forward or you'll bump into something.

14:29.720 --> 14:30.610
Okay.

14:33.810 --> 14:34.710
Hey...

14:34.710 --> 14:35.930
I'm sorry.

14:46.400 --> 14:50.280
By now, Hiiragi and the others are probably in skating class...

14:50.280 --> 14:53.580
Kureha? What about school?

14:54.110 --> 14:56.760
I'm free to go to school or not until I graduate.

14:56.760 --> 15:00.160
I am a third year student, unlike Hiiragi.

15:01.070 --> 15:03.880
By 'unlike Hiiragi', you mean...

15:05.010 --> 15:07.020
He's currently a second year student.

15:07.020 --> 15:08.960
He dropped a year again?

15:08.960 --> 15:11.660
It must be hard for him.

15:13.680 --> 15:14.780
What is it?

15:14.780 --> 15:22.250
I was just remembering how Hiiragi used to fight to protect you and this world.

15:24.900 --> 15:26.750
Are you still doing your missions with Hiiragi?

15:26.750 --> 15:27.440
Yes.

15:28.250 --> 15:29.040
I see.

15:29.850 --> 15:33.780
This time, be sure to protect this world that he saved, together with him.

15:34.710 --> 15:36.010
Be strong.

15:36.570 --> 15:37.510
Yes.

15:39.150 --> 15:41.000
Ah, breakfast.

15:41.000 --> 15:42.270
I'm famished.

15:43.640 --> 15:45.730
Here, please help yourselves.

15:46.920 --> 15:48.560
It looks delicious!

15:48.560 --> 15:49.990
Itadakimasu.

15:49.990 --> 15:51.590
Which one shall I start with?

15:52.250 --> 15:55.640
I made some drinks as well. Let me prepare them for you.

15:56.660 --> 16:00.480
Actually, I also made a bento.

16:01.460 --> 16:04.110
Akari-chan, you're good at cooking as well?

16:04.110 --> 16:05.120
I'm quite skilled.

16:05.120 --> 16:06.770
Take it out, take it out.

16:06.770 --> 16:08.900
No, stop it, her's is...

16:10.340 --> 16:11.190
Here.

16:11.590 --> 16:14.860
Like I expected, you're good at everything.

16:14.860 --> 16:16.070
Wait, this...

16:16.070 --> 16:17.750
Can I have some?

16:18.250 --> 16:19.000
Of course.

16:19.000 --> 16:20.750
All right! Itadakima-

16:25.250 --> 16:27.980
Hiiragi-senpai, that's not fair!

16:27.980 --> 16:31.510
Let us eat your bento.

16:43.740 --> 16:45.020
Thanks for the food.

16:45.020 --> 16:46.050
It was delicious.

16:46.690 --> 16:48.350
Glad to hear that.

16:48.350 --> 16:50.630
Elis, what about today's dessert?

16:50.630 --> 16:53.280
Don't worry, I have it here with me.

16:55.000 --> 16:56.780
It's raspberry tart.

16:57.220 --> 16:59.280
Something to clean my throat!

17:00.460 --> 17:05.790
For a raspberry tart, wouldn't this raspberry tea go just perfectly?

17:07.540 --> 17:08.950
Anzelotte-san...

17:08.950 --> 17:10.720
Why are you in a place like this?!

17:10.720 --> 17:13.170
How about some tea, everyone?

17:13.830 --> 17:15.760
Thank you very much.

17:16.260 --> 17:17.010
Thank you.

17:17.010 --> 17:18.010
Hey...

17:18.010 --> 17:20.510
The sweet and sour flavor of the tart is being drawn out even more...

17:20.510 --> 17:22.020
It is even more delicious, don't you think?

17:22.020 --> 17:23.970
It's true...

17:23.970 --> 17:26.390
Hey! How can you be so laid back drinking tea?!

17:26.390 --> 17:29.870
You're not in a very good mood are you, Hiiragi-san?

17:29.870 --> 17:32.760
Aren't you here to give us our next mission?

17:32.760 --> 17:39.260
Please be at ease, I'm here today just to have some dessert.

17:42.200 --> 17:47.760
Hey, wait a minute. You say dessert but... That's mine you're eating!

17:49.310 --> 17:52.170
Breakfast break is over, everyone gather around!

17:53.830 --> 17:55.010
I'll see you again.

17:56.080 --> 17:58.430
Keep up the good work, Elis-san.

18:00.560 --> 18:01.600
Okay.

18:08.490 --> 18:10.190
Is it all right like this?

18:10.850 --> 18:14.420
Yes, let them live peacefully for this one day.

18:29.020 --> 18:30.920
Come on, let's practice some more.

18:35.560 --> 18:37.010
It's okay.

18:44.560 --> 18:45.390
Hey...

18:56.320 --> 19:01.070
Hiiragi-senpai, I am sorry for always counting on you.

19:01.070 --> 19:03.550
But I am fine now.

19:08.790 --> 19:11.330
Quite the hardworking type, huh?

19:31.700 --> 19:32.710
It's cute...

19:32.710 --> 19:33.440
Doesn't this one look good?

19:33.860 --> 19:37.450
I really think that red would fit Kureha-san. What do you think?

19:37.450 --> 19:40.320
Not really. Any color would be fine.

19:40.620 --> 19:41.600
Eh?!

19:42.210 --> 19:45.280
Ah! I think orange suits you, Akari-chan.

19:46.240 --> 19:48.010
Mine would be pink.

19:48.010 --> 19:50.120
Let's buy one of these for everyone.

19:50.710 --> 19:54.170
Sensei, please don't put me as late.

19:55.970 --> 20:00.720
Well, you did take good care of Shiho today, so I guess I'll put you as present then.

20:00.720 --> 20:02.240
Really?!

20:02.240 --> 20:04.010
THANK YOU!!

20:14.610 --> 20:16.810
Ah, it's so cute!

20:16.810 --> 20:18.410
Thank you!

20:18.410 --> 20:20.870
I chose it with Akari-chan.

20:21.850 --> 20:23.650
We all have the same design.

20:24.850 --> 20:26.030
I'll put it on mine!

20:26.030 --> 20:29.160
The same, the same, the same!

20:30.820 --> 20:32.540
Hiiragi-senpai...

20:32.540 --> 20:34.600
Shall I help you carry one?

20:34.600 --> 20:37.350
No, this much is nothing, really.

20:37.350 --> 20:38.420
Is that so?

20:38.420 --> 20:42.290
Say, Elis-chan, what's on the menu for dinner?

20:42.290 --> 20:43.750
Yukimidame.

20:43.750 --> 20:49.510
Looking at the skating rink made me think that there's only one thing suitable for our dinner tonight.

20:50.930 --> 20:53.520
So that's why you bought three radishes.

20:53.520 --> 20:54.100
Yes.

20:54.620 --> 20:57.280
Hiiragi, aren't you good at grating radish?

20:57.280 --> 20:58.790
Since you are the 'fallen man'.

20:58.790 --> 21:00.720
Stop calling me that!

21:00.720 --> 21:03.070
You're going to grate all three of them!

21:03.070 --> 21:04.780
Not going to happen!

21:11.530 --> 21:15.670
Grating all three of them at once... is hard!

21:17.460 --> 21:22.000
Kureha-san, Akari-chan was really good at skating.

21:22.860 --> 21:24.340
That's my Akarin.

21:24.340 --> 21:26.970
I wished I could've gone with all of you.

21:26.970 --> 21:28.920
Next time why don't we all go together?

21:28.920 --> 21:30.330
Ah, I'm in!

21:33.180 --> 21:35.010
It's cold.

21:37.900 --> 21:39.320
What's this?

21:44.250 --> 21:45.190
This...

21:52.410 --> 21:57.540
Today has been a great day, and I was able to stay in class for the whole day.

21:59.710 --> 22:03.420
Let's hope days like this will continue forever.

22:00.820 --> 22:02.530
Hiiragi, that's my radish!

22:02.530 --> 22:03.420
Shut up!

22:04.230 --> 22:05.000
Give me that!

22:05.000 --> 22:06.790
No, I won't!

22:06.350 --> 22:07.440
That's mine.

22:10.200 --> 22:12.910
From Europe, America, and China,

22:12.910 --> 22:16.760
we've received reports of massive Lunar Caskets appearing in seven places around the world.

22:16.760 --> 22:19.990
A vortex is starting to appear on the world's barrier.

22:19.990 --> 22:24.350
Our ruler on the Lunar Casket appearing in Blaston Berry in Europe...

22:24.350 --> 22:28.860
shows a probability of more than 98%. We're guessing that it is the greater Devil Pao Kurl.

22:29.570 --> 22:34.410
We are detecting a great number of enemy groups amassing in the skies above the Arctic Ocean.

22:34.410 --> 22:36.880
Their numbers are too large. They are blocking the skies.

22:36.880 --> 22:38.970
Only thirty percent of the sky is visible...

22:38.970 --> 22:41.040
Only thirty percent of the sky is visible!

22:41.700 --> 22:48.710
A team is currently protecting the Scandinavian area, the devil Kami Yukaini and Mariana Islands devil Phorne Lucius.

22:48.710 --> 22:51.690
The Lunar Casket is expanding. It is starting to move!

22:51.690 --> 22:55.010
Possible target is Shiho Elis!

22:55.980 --> 23:00.590
It looks like Devils other than Bell have started to realize that the jewels are being gathered.

23:00.590 --> 23:02.440
Yes, I'm afraid so.

23:03.030 --> 23:05.540
Only two jewels left.

23:05.540 --> 23:08.440
If we don't make haste, the world...

24:50.330 --> 24:52.270
Oji-sama, I can't believe what is happening!

24:52.270 --> 24:56.640
Hiiragi-senpai and I have been thrown back into the past!

24:56.640 --> 24:59.250
The tower hidden inside the sandstorm.

24:59.250 --> 25:01.180
Don't tell me that's the legendary...!!

25:01.180 --> 25:04.440
Hiiragi-senpai, let's send Kureha-san a picture mail!

25:04.440 --> 25:06.310
Huh? We're out of reach?

25:06.310 --> 25:11.230
Next on Night Wizard THE ANIMATION, Jumping Through Time, The Girl's Tower.

25:11.230 --> 25:15.010
Does history want to get in my way from going to school?
